---
import FieldNotesLayout from '../layouts/FieldNotesLayout.astro';
import FootnoteList from '../components/FootnoteList.astro';
import { footnotes } from '../data/footnotes';
import { copyrightYear } from '../utils/copyrightYear';

const year = copyrightYear();
---
<FieldNotesLayout title="Legal & Regulatory Notices" description="Legal and regulatory notices and website disclaimer for BiomEdit, Inc.">
  <div class="legal-page">
    <h1>Legal &amp; Regulatory Notices / Website Disclaimer</h1>

    <div class="legal-body">
      <h2>General Informational Use</h2>
      <p>The information provided on this website by BiomEdit, Inc. (&ldquo;BiomEdit,&rdquo; &ldquo;we,&rdquo; &ldquo;us,&rdquo; or &ldquo;our&rdquo;)&mdash;including information regarding our executive team, scientific advisory board, board of directors, corporate partners, and investors&mdash;is for general informational and educational purposes only. While we endeavor to keep information accurate and up to date, we make no representations or warranties of any kind, express or implied, regarding the completeness, accuracy, or reliability of any information on the site.</p>

      <h2>Research &amp; Development Pipeline Disclaimer</h2>
      <p>Descriptions of our proprietary technology platforms, research programs, development candidates, and estimated project timelines represent forward-looking statements subject to inherent scientific, competitive, and regulatory risks and uncertainties. Our development processes are experimental in nature, and actual outcomes may differ materially from expectations. BiomEdit provides this information as of its original publication date and assumes no obligation to update, amend, or refresh pipeline statements as new data or circumstances arise.</p>

      <h2>No Investment Advice or Securities Offer</h2>
      <p>Nothing contained on this website constitutes investment, legal, tax, or other advice, nor should it be relied upon in making an investment or other decision. Content on this site does not constitute an offer to sell, or a solicitation of an offer to purchase, any securities, equity, or financial instruments of BiomEdit, Inc.</p>

      <h2>Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p>BiomEdit&trade;, Optavant&trade;, BiomElix&reg; and other corporate logos, product names, service names, marks and brand slogans referenced on this website are trademarks or registered trademarks of BiomEdit, Inc. All rights reserved. The subject product is covered by one or more U.S. patents, including U.S. Patent Nos. 12,599,637 and 12,427,174. Additional U.S. and foreign patents may be pending. All materials and content on the website are copyrighted by BiomEdit, Inc. Copyright&copy; {year} BiomEdit, Inc. All rights reserved. BiomEdit&rsquo;s technology and product candidates are protected by issued patents and pending patent applications in the U.S. and internationally, including U.S. Patent Nos. 12,599,637 and 12,427,174. Issued patents cover specific claims granted by patent offices, and no representation is made that pending applications will issue with comparable claims. No license or right to use any BiomEdit intellectual property is granted without express prior written permission.</p>

      <h3>Third-Party Trademarks &amp; Logo Ownership</h3>
      <p>All third-party trademarks, service marks, trade names, trade dress, product names, and logos appearing on this page&mdash;including Anterra Capital, Viking Global Investors, Betagro Ventures, Elevate Ventures, Nutreco, AgriZeroNZ, Bill &amp; Melinda Gates Foundation, Elanco, USDA, NIH, Ginkgo Bioworks, Ferment, TechPoint, and S&amp;P Global&mdash;are the property of their respective owners. Their display on this site does not imply endorsement, sponsorship, or affiliation except as formally contracted.</p>

      <h2>Biographical and Team Information</h2>
      <p>Biographical information, officer titles and Director information are provided for general informational purposes only as of the date posted. Direct contact or communications through listed personnel profiles do not constitute formal legal, binding, or commercial commitments on behalf of BiomEdit, Inc.</p>

      <h2>About USDA Conditional License</h2>
      <p>USDA has issued a conditional license for the product CPerf LLV* in accordance with regulation 9 CFR 102.6. The approved claim is: &ldquo;This product has shown a reasonable expectation of efficacy for passive immunity of healthy chicks against <em>Clostridium perfringens</em>. Duration of passive immunity has not been determined. The license is conditional; efficacy and potency have not been fully demonstrated.&rdquo; Conditional licensure enables commercialization in the US while additional effectiveness and potency data are developed as required for full product licensure. Product use is subject to federal and state regulatory requirements.</p>

      <h2>R&amp;D Pipeline Disclaimer</h2>
      <p>Pipeline candidates (BE-105, BE-122) are experimental products in development, have not been approved by the FDA or USDA, and are not available for commercial sale. Pipeline details are provided for informational purposes only, are subject to change, and BiomEdit, Inc. assumes no obligation to update this content.</p>

      <h2>Referenced Footnotes throughout the Website</h2>
      <FootnoteList items={[footnotes[1], footnotes[2], footnotes[3], footnotes[4]]} />
    </div>
  </div>
</FieldNotesLayout>

<style>
  .legal-page { padding: 4rem 0 3rem; }
  .legal-page h1 { font-size: var(--text-h3); margin: 0 0 2.5rem; }

  .legal-body { max-width: 680px; }
  .legal-body h2 { font-size: var(--text-h6); margin: 2.5rem 0 1rem; }
  .legal-body h2:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
  .legal-body h3 { font-size: 17px; margin: 1.75rem 0 0.75rem; }
  .legal-body p { font-size: var(--text-body); line-height: 1.6; color: var(--text-primary); margin: 0 0 1.25rem; }
</style>
